---
title: "Snippet contracts"
description: "Typed arguments for cropper, stencil and preview snippets."
---

# Snippet contracts

Each replacement is a Svelte `Snippet<[ArgumentType]>`. Import argument types from `svelte-advanced-cropper` and `Snippet` from `svelte`. All visual arguments inherit `PartProps`: optional `class: ClassValue` and `style: string`.

## Cropper snippets

| Prop | Argument | Default renderer |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `wrapper` | `CropperWrapperSnippetProps<E>` | `CropperWrapper` |
| `boundary` | `CropperBoundarySnippetProps<E>` | `StretchableBoundary` |
| `backgroundWrapper` | `CropperBackgroundWrapperSnippetProps<E>` | `CropperBackgroundWrapper` |
| `background` | `CropperBackgroundSnippetProps<E>` | `CropperBackgroundImage` |

Wrapper arguments include `cropper`, `disabled` and `children`. Background arguments have no children. Extension typing stays intact through the cropper snippets. Wrappers must render their supplied children exactly once and preserve class/style.

<h2 id="preview-snippets">Preview snippets</h2>

| Prop | Argument | Default renderer |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `wrapper` | `CropperPreviewWrapperSnippetProps` | `CropperPreviewWrapper` |
| `boundary` | `CropperPreviewBoundarySnippetProps` | `StretchableBoundary` |
| `background` | `CropperPreviewBackgroundSnippetProps` | `CropperPreviewBackground` |

Preview arguments use `preview`, and the background receives the computed `size`. No preview export-source attachment is needed.

## Stencil controls

`handler?: Snippet<[HandlerSnippetProps]>` and `line?: Snippet<[LineSnippetProps]>` default to `SimpleHandler` and `SimpleLine`. The snippet replaces the interactive control; BoundingBox retains the handler's outer placement container. Forward the native event and end callback as well as positioning classes.

## Registration ownership

`registerBoundary` returns cleanup that removes only that registration. `attachSource(ready?)` returns a Svelte attachment for the actual displayed image or canvas. Its cleanup cannot remove a replacement. A readiness promise represents pixels drawn for the current image; stale sources are not export fallbacks. See [layer composition](/docs/composition/layers).

## Exact declarations

`Attachment` comes from `svelte/attachments`. `Normalized*ImageOptions` are the fully populated gesture option types. Other geometry types are available from the package root.

```ts
interface PartProps {
	class?: ClassValue;
	style?: string;
}
type CrossOrigin = boolean | 'anonymous' | 'use-credentials';
interface BoundaryHandle {
	stretchTo(size: Size | null): Promise<Size | null>;
	reset(): void;
}
type RegisterBoundary = (boundary: BoundaryHandle) => () => void;
type BackgroundElement = HTMLImageElement | HTMLCanvasElement;
type AttachBackgroundSource = (ready?: Promise<void>) => Attachment<BackgroundElement>;
interface CropperWrapperSnippetProps<E extends SettingsExtension = {}> extends PartProps {
	cropper: CropperInstance<E>;
	disabled: boolean;
	children: Snippet;
}
interface CropperBoundarySnippetProps<
	E extends SettingsExtension = {}
> extends CropperWrapperSnippetProps<E> {
	registerBoundary: RegisterBoundary;
	sizeAlgorithm: BoundarySizeAlgorithm;
	stretchAlgorithm: BoundaryStretchAlgorithm;
}
interface CropperBackgroundWrapperSnippetProps<
	E extends SettingsExtension = {}
> extends CropperWrapperSnippetProps<E> {
	moveImage: NormalizedMoveImageOptions;
	scaleImage: NormalizedScaleImageOptions;
	rotateImage: NormalizedRotateImageOptions;
}
interface CropperBackgroundSnippetProps<E extends SettingsExtension = {}> extends PartProps {
	cropper: CropperInstance<E>;
	disabled: boolean;
	crossOrigin: CrossOrigin;
	attachSource: AttachBackgroundSource;
}
interface CropperPreviewWrapperSnippetProps extends PartProps {
	preview: CropperPreviewSource;
	children: Snippet;
}
interface CropperPreviewBoundarySnippetProps extends CropperPreviewWrapperSnippetProps {
	registerBoundary: RegisterBoundary;
	sizeAlgorithm: BoundarySizeAlgorithm;
	stretchAlgorithm: BoundaryStretchAlgorithm;
}
interface CropperPreviewBackgroundSnippetProps extends PartProps {
	preview: CropperPreviewSource;
	size: Size | null;
	crossOrigin: CrossOrigin;
}
type NativeMoveEvent = MouseEvent | TouchEvent;
interface HandlerSnippetProps extends PartProps {
	position: OrdinalDirection;
	horizontalPosition: HorizontalCardinalDirection | null;
	verticalPosition: VerticalCardinalDirection | null;
	disabled: boolean;
	onMove: (shift: MoveDirections, event: NativeMoveEvent) => void;
	onMoveEnd: () => void;
}
interface LineSnippetProps extends PartProps {
	position: CardinalDirection;
	disabled: boolean;
	onMove: (shift: MoveDirections, event: NativeMoveEvent) => void;
	onMoveEnd: () => void;
}
```
